4-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2ef4e443-32d0-4516-8673-335194a471f9_1500x844.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>The Frontier Psychiatrists Daily’s Clubhouse discussion with special guest Fredrick Brennan, the founder and detractor of 8chan, brought up topics ranging from conspiracy theories and suppression of speech to disability, support and the difference between  who we are online and off.  Check out the Graphic Recording, above. </p><div class=\"twitter-embed\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://twitter.com/Clubhouse/status/1393991695390461961&quot;,&quot;full_text&quot;:&quot;Transparent and stigma-free conversations are key to better mental health care 🧠 \\n\\n<span class=\\&quot;tweet-fake-link\\&quot;>@CarleneMac</span> is about to drop facts with <span class=\\&quot;tweet-fake-link\\&quot;>@fr_brennan</span>, @ephvasquez &amp;amp; <span class=\\&quot;tweet-fake-link\\&quot;>@OwenMuirMD</span> starting now! \\n\\n<a class=\\&quot;tweet-url\\&quot; href=\\&quot;https://www.joinclubhouse.com/event/M1WZ0R73\\&quot;>joinclubhouse.com/event/M1WZ0R73</a> &quot;,&quot;username&quot;:&quot;Clubhouse&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Clubhouse&quot;,&quot;profile_image_url&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;date&quot;:&quot;Sun May 16 18:08:13 +0000 2021&quot;,&quot;photos&quot;:[{&quot;img_url&quot;:&quot;https://pbs.substack.com/media/E1h0CNlWUAUQVOO.jpg&quot;,&quot;link_url&quot;:&quot;https://t.co/SvxKfDpApM&quot;,&quot;alt_text&quot;:null}],&quot;quoted_tweet&quot;:{},&quot;reply_count&quot;:0,&quot;retweet_count&quot;:12,&quot;like_count&quot;:107,&quot;impression_count&quot;:0,&quot;expanded_url&quot;:{},&quot;video_url&quot;:null,&quot;video_preview_media_key&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false}\" data-component-name=\"Twitter2ToDOM\"></div><p>In case you missed it, you can read a review of the pilot episode by Brian Penny on <a href=\"https://clubhouseconversations.substack.com/p/creator-first-pilot-review-the-frontier\">Clubhouse Conversations</a>.</p><p>Will Clubhouse pick up our pilot? We’ll let you know as soon as we hear! In the meantime, please follow our <a href=\"https://www.joinclubhouse.com/join/sphere/kVrqLJA4/M83q2AJJ\">Sphere</a> club on Clubhouse for more discussions on mental health with Dr. Carlene MacMillan and Dr. Owen Muir.</p><p>Join us this Thursday, May 20th from 12-5PM EST for Mental Health Action Day.</p>","text":"The Frontier Psychiatrists Daily’s Clubhouse discussion with special guest Fredrick Brennan, the founder and detractor of 8chan, brought up topics ranging from conspiracy theories and suppression of speech to disability, support and the difference between who we are online and off. Check out the Graphic Recording, above.\n\n@CarleneMac is about to drop facts with @fr_brennan , @ephvasquez &amp; @OwenMuirMD starting now! \\n\\n joinclubhouse.com/event/M1WZ0R73 \",\"username\":\"Clubhouse\",\"name\":\"Clubhouse\",\"profile_image_url\":\"\",\"date\":\"Sun May 16 18:08:13 +0000 2021\",\"photos\":[{\"img_url\":\"https://pbs.substack.com/media/E1h0CNlWUAUQVOO.jpg\",\"link_url\":\"https://t.co/SvxKfDpApM\",\"alt_text\":null}],\"quoted_tweet\":{},\"reply_count\":0,\"retweet_count\":12,\"like_count\":107,\"impression_count\":0,\"expanded_url\":{},\"video_url\":null,\"video_preview_media_key\":null,\"belowTheFold\":false}\" data-component-name=\"Twitter2ToDOM\">\n\nIn case you missed it, you can read a review of the pilot episode by Brian Penny on Clubhouse Conversations .\n\nWill Clubhouse pick up our pilot? We’ll let you know as soon as we hear! In the meantime, please follow our Sphere club on Clubhouse for more discussions on mental health with Dr. Carlene MacMillan and Dr. Owen Muir.\n\nJoin us this Thursday, May 20th from 12-5PM EST for Mental Health Action Day."}